<div class="lf-notes lf-no-break"><div class="lf-notes-title">課堂筆記 / 草稿區</div><div class="lf-notes-lines"></div></div></div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 分數計算陷阱 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：分數計算陷阱總攻（T9）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>分數計算五步驗證法：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>看分母</strong>：相同？直接加減。不同？先通分<br/>
      ② <strong>找 LCM</strong>：用短除法求最小公倍數（不是隨便找一個公倍數！）<br/>
      ③ <strong>通分</strong>：分子 = 原分子 × (LCM ÷ 原分母) —— <strong>必須同步擴大</strong><br/>
      ④ <strong>計算</strong>：分母不變，分子相加減<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>約簡</strong>：找分子分母的 HCF → 約至最簡 → 假分數化帶分數
    </div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">搵 LCM</div><div class="d">短除法<br/>最小公倍數</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">通分</div><div class="d">分子同步<br/>分母變LCM</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">計算</div><div class="d">分母不變<br/>分子加減</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">約簡</div><div class="d">最簡分數<br/>假→帶分數</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 KP2-1：異分母加法</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q"><span class="fd"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">12</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 KP2-2：含帶分數的減法</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">2<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> − 1<span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣：「帶分先轉假，通分搵 LCM，分子跟住乘，答案必定約」</div>
<div class="lf-h2">KP2 同步練習 — 分數計算（第 11-25 題）</div>
