</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: KP3 綜合計算策略 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：綜合計算策略 — 驗證 ＝ 滿分 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>計算題滿分策略（不是算完就算，要驗證！）：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>估算驗證法</strong>：心算大約值（例如 2.98 × 4.1 ≈ 3×4 = 12，答案應接近 12）<br/>
      ② <strong>逆運算驗證</strong>：加法用減法驗、乘法用除法驗<br/>
      ③ <strong>單位檢查</strong>：答案的單位對嗎？小數點位置合理嗎？<br/>
      ④ <strong>尾數檢查</strong>：只看個位數／最後一位，快速驗證<br/>
      ⑤ <strong>特殊值警惕</strong>：×0.5 = ÷2，÷0.5 = ×2，÷0.1 = ×10
    </div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 KP3-1：估算驗證</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算 198 × 52 = ？先用估算判斷以下哪個答案合理：A. 1,029 B. 10,296 C. 102,960</div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">例題 KP3-2：分數與小數混合</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">計算 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + 0.25 = ？（統一化成小數或分數）</div>
<div class="lf-ex-try"><p style="font-weight:700;color:var(--lf-blue);">試試看！寫出你的計算步驟：</p></div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 呈分試卷一計算題 35% 失分來自「沒有驗證」而非「不會算」。養成估算習慣！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">KP3 綜合計算練習（第 26-35 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">26</td><td>估算：4,987 × 31 ≈ ？哪個最接近？A. 15,000 B. 155,000 C. 1,550,000</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">27</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + 0.5 = ？（化成小數計算）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">28</td><td>用估算驗證：12,345 + 87,655 大約 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">29</td><td>0.75 + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（統一化分數計算）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">30</td><td>2.5 × 4.2 = ？先用估算（2.5×4=10），再精算。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">31</td><td>用逆運算驗證：如果 3,456 ÷ 12 = 288，用乘法驗證。</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">32</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> + 0.6 = ？（統一化：0.4 + 0.6 = ?）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">33</td><td>估算：0.48 × 9.7 ≈ ？哪個最接近？A. 0.4656 B. 4.656 C. 46.56</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">34</td><td>1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + 0.75 = ？（1.25 + 0.75 = ?）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">35</td><td>計算 1 − <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> − 0.25 = ？（先後加減，注意次序）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">衝刺提速練習（第 36-45 題 · 限時 15 分鐘）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">36</td><td>45,678 + 54,322 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">37</td><td>0.8 × 0.25 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">38</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">39</td><td>1,000,000 − 456,789 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">40</td><td>0.06 × 0.5 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">41</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> − <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">9</span></span> = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">42</td><td>2,345 × 67 = ？（用估算驗證答案合理性）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">43</td><td><span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> = ？（三數通分）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">44</td><td>0.125 + <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span> = ？（0.125 = <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">8</span></span>）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:72px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">45</td><td>4<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> + 2<span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> − 1<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> = ？（加減混合 — 建議全轉假分數）</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:80px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
